OL,3,GNEWSAReform UK's Richard Tice calls for
OL,4,Amore North Sea drilling
OL,5,
OL,6,FReform UK's deputy leader has said
OL,7,Fevery last drop of oil and gas should
OL,8,Fbe extracted from the North Sea.
OL,10,FRichard Tice told BBC Scotland News the
OL,11,Fpolicy should be "drill, Scotland,
OL,12,Fdrill" and called it "our energy
OL,13,Ftreasure".
OL,15,FTice was speaking ahead of the party's
OL,16,Fconference this week in Birmingham -
OL,17,Falthough parties usually send their
OL,18,Fleader on the media circuit.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
